@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@phoneA = 13800000001
@passwordA = Test123456
@phoneB = 13800000002
@passwordB = Test123456
@tokenA = paste-user-a-token-here
@tokenB = paste-user-b-token-here
@idempotencyTokenA = paste-user-a-idempotency-token-here
@idempotencyTokenB = paste-user-b-idempotency-token-here
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@orderIdA = 1
@cancelOrderId = 2
@closedOrderId = 3
@paymentNoA = PAY_PASTE_HERE
@failedPaymentNo = PAY_FAILED_PASTE_HERE
@cancelledOrderPaymentNo = PAY_CANCELLED_PASTE_HERE
@closedOrderPaymentNo = PAY_CLOSED_PASTE_HERE
@mockPayTimestamp = 1760000000000
@mockPayNonce = replace-with-uuid-or-random-string
@mockPaySignature = paste-hmac-sha256-signature-here
@mockPayRepeatSignature = paste-hmac-sha256-signature-for-repeat-nonce-here
@mockPayFailedSignature = paste-hmac-sha256-signature-for-failed-payment-here
@mockPayCancelledSignature = paste-hmac-sha256-signature-for-cancelled-payment-here
@mockPayClosedSignature = paste-hmac-sha256-signature-for-closed-payment-here


### 1. 注册用户 B，用于越权验证；如果已注册会返回重复手机号
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "payment_user_b",
  "phone": "{{phoneB}}",
  "password": "{{passwordB}}"
}


### 2. 用户 A 登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginName": "{{phoneA}}",
  "password": "{{passwordA}}"
}


### 3. 用户 B 登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginName": "{{phoneB}}",
  "password": "{{passwordB}}"
}


### 4. 用户 A 获取下单幂等 token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### 5. [已废弃] 用户 A 同步创建订单，请求体不传 userId；阶段 4B 后主链路请用 /api/orders/async
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyTokenA}}"
}


### 6. 用户 A 创建支付单，amount 来自订单 totalAmount
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/create
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderIdA}},
  "channel": "MOCK"
}


### 7. 重复创建支付单，应返回已有 payment_order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/create
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderIdA}},
  "channel": "MOCK"
}


### 8. 用户 A 查询自己的支付单成功
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/{{paymentNoA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### 9. 用户 B 查询用户 A 的支付单失败
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/{{paymentNoA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}


### 10. 用户 A mock-pay 支付成功
### 阶段 4D 后 mock-pay 不再是裸接口，必须使用配置 smart-ticket.payment.mock-callback-secret
### 按 paymentNo + success + timestamp + nonce 计算 HMAC-SHA256 签名。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentNo": "{{paymentNoA}}",
  "success": true,
  "timestamp": {{mockPayTimestamp}},
  "nonce": "{{mockPayNonce}}",
  "signature": "{{mockPaySignature}}"
}


### 11. 查询订单，应为 PAID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderIdA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### 12. 重复 mock-pay 成功，应幂等，不重复增加 sold_stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentNo": "{{paymentNoA}}",
  "success": true,
  "timestamp": {{mockPayTimestamp}},
  "nonce": "{{mockPayNonce}}-repeat",
  "signature": "{{mockPayRepeatSignature}}"
}


### 13. 旧直接支付接口已废弃，不能绕过 payment_order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderIdA}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### 14. mock-pay 支付失败示例；先为另一个待支付订单创建 paymentNo 后替换变量
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentNo": "{{failedPaymentNo}}",
  "success": false,
  "timestamp": {{mockPayTimestamp}},
  "nonce": "{{mockPayNonce}}-failed",
  "signature": "{{mockPayFailedSignature}}"
}


### 15. 取消订单后再支付应失败；先为 @cancelOrderId 创建待支付订单和支付单，再取消订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{cancelOrderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### 16. 取消后支付应失败
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentNo": "{{cancelledOrderPaymentNo}}",
  "success": true,
  "timestamp": {{mockPayTimestamp}},
  "nonce": "{{mockPayNonce}}-cancelled",
  "signature": "{{mockPayCancelledSignature}}"
}


### 17. 超时关闭后支付应失败；先为 @closedOrderId 创建支付单，等待订单超时 CLOSED，再执行
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentNo": "{{closedOrderPaymentNo}}",
  "success": true,
  "timestamp": {{mockPayTimestamp}},
  "nonce": "{{mockPayNonce}}-closed",
  "signature": "{{mockPayClosedSignature}}"
}
